. Total hold time was 4 days (28 Sep to 2 Oct) because the amended declaratio=
n needed a further check after it was resubmitted.

Free time ran out during the hold, so demurrage will be charged. I will get t=
he invoice and send it to Finance when it arrives. Thanks both for the quick =
turnaround on the amendment.

Regards,
